@page "/"

<PageTitle>BlazorQuiz — Learn with momentum</PageTitle>
<div class="landing-page">
    <section class="landing-hero">
        <div class="landing-copy">
            <span class="hero-kicker"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill"></i> Learn. Measure. Improve.</span>
            <h1>Knowledge grows when progress feels visible.</h1>
            <p>Focused quizzes, adaptive assignments, meaningful analytics, and real achievements—built into one calm learning space.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <AuthorizeView>
                    <Authorized><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/assignments">Continue learning <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a></Authorized>
                    <NotAuthorized><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/Account/Register">Start learning free <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a></NotAuthorized>
                </AuthorizeView>
                <a class="btn btn-quiet btn-lg" href="/quiz"><i class="bi bi-play-circle"></i> Try a quiz</a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-proof"><div><strong>Adaptive</strong><span>Questions meet your level</span></div><div><strong>Actionable</strong><span>Insights beyond a score</span></div><div><strong>Rewarding</strong><span>Certificates that mark growth</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Learning progress preview">
            <div class="visual-grid"></div>
            <article class="floating-panel progress-panel"><span class="eyebrow">Weekly momentum</span><strong>+18%</strong><div class="mini-bars"><i style="height:30%"></i><i style="height:48%"></i><i style="height:40%"></i><i style="height:72%"></i><i style="height:92%"></i></div></article>
            <article class="floating-panel question-panel"><span class="difficulty-chip">Adaptive · Medium</span><h3>Which pattern keeps services loosely coupled?</h3><div class="mini-answer selected"><span>A</span>Dependency injection</div><div class="mini-answer"><span>B</span>Global state</div></article>
            <div class="achievement-bubble"><i class="bi bi-award-fill"></i><span><strong>Milestone earned</strong>ASP.NET Core Foundations</span></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-strip"><span>One workspace for</span><strong>Independent learners</strong><i></i><strong>Instructors</strong><i></i><strong>Training teams</strong><i></i><strong>Schools</strong></section>

    <section class="feature-story">
        <div class="story-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A better learning loop</span><h2>Every attempt should tell you what to do next.</h2></div>
        <div class="story-grid">
            <article><span>01</span><i class="bi bi-compass"></i><h3>Start at the right level</h3><p>Adaptive assignments respond to performance during the attempt, keeping challenge productive.</p></article>
            <article><span>02</span><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i><h3>See the signal</h3><p>Category trends, question-level insights, and history turn scores into a useful direction.</p></article>
            <article><span>03</span><i class="bi bi-patch-check"></i><h3>Mark real progress</h3><p>Pass milestones, earn verifiable certificates, and keep a record of every achievement.</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="topic-rail"><div><span class="eyebrow">Explore the question bank</span><h2>Choose a path. Build momentum.</h2></div><div class="topic-pills"><a href="/quiz?category=C%23">C#</a><a href="/quiz?category=ASP.NET%20Core">ASP.NET Core</a><a href="/quiz?category=Blazor">Blazor</a><a href="/quiz?category=JavaScript">JavaScript</a><a href="/quiz?category=Database">Databases</a><a href="/quiz">All topics <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a></div></section>

    <section class="home-cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">Your next milestone</span><h2>Make the next twenty minutes count.</h2></div><AuthorizeView><Authorized><a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href="/assignments">Open learning hub</a></Authorized><NotAuthorized><a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href="/Account/Register">Create free account</a></NotAuthorized></AuthorizeView></section>
</div>
